    "summary": "Costs 1 CP. In your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), pick an **ADEPTUS MECHANICUS** unit. If it has **HALO OVERRIDE**, it takes D3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) and gets one chosen [Override ability](vsdata:ability/adeptus-mechanicus.haloscreed-battle-clade.noospheric-transference) until your next [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins. This can run alongside existing Overrides, even when the unit was already targeted for one. Without **HALO OVERRIDE**, give it just the chosen Override until your next [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins.",
